    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i get that, but my doctor is always so dismissive of herbal stuff. like, it's just a plant, right? i looked it up online and a lot of people say it's totally natural and fine for mild stuff like this. is there like a specific way i should take it so it doesn't interfere? maybe just a small dose or something?",
