      "content": "While you're right that St. John's Wort is a plant, the way it interacts with your body, especially considering its effects on liver enzymes, can be unpredictable and problematic when not professionally supervised. Even small doses can have consistent interactions with oral contraceptives, potentially diminishing their effectiveness. It's not just about the quantity but the interaction itself. Finding safer ways to boost your mood will still be the best advice, possibly including professional counseling or talking to a pharmacist. Always consult with a healthcare professional about any supplement, medication, or treatment to ensure it's tailored to your specific health needs and conditions.",
